{"0301208d-258a-444a-8ef7-66e433d801b1":{"id":"0301208d-258a-444a-8ef7-66e433d801b1","title":"Ryoushin no Shakkin wo Katagawari Shite Morau Jouken wa Nihon Ichi Kawaii Joshikousei to Issho ni Kurasu Koto deshita.","altTitle":"I'm Gonna Live with You Not Because My Parents Left Me Their Debt but Because I Like You","description":"Tokoh utama, Yoshizumi Yuya, dipaksa untuk melunasi hutang yang ditinggalkan oleh orang tuanya yang melarikan diri ke luar negeri. Itu adalah teman sekelasnya, Hitotsuba Kaede, terpilih sebagai siswi terimut di Jepang, yang menyelamatkannya dari krisis hidup dan mati ini. Namun, ada motif tersembunyi di balik itu. Syarat yang harus dipenuhi sebagai imbalan untuk melunasi utangnya adalah — “Sebagai imbalan atas pinjaman itu, kau harus tinggal bersamaku.” “Kenapa jadi begitu?!” Kehidupan sehari-hari Yuya runtuh pada hari ini. “Yuya-kun. Ayo mandi bersama.” “Yuya-kun, jadilah bantal pelukku.” “Cukup, Hitotsuba-san!” Kisah cinta komedi romantis yang menggugah antara Hitotsuba Kaede yang cantik namun santai dan Yoshizumi Yuya yang serius dan keras kepala, dimulai sekarang!","year":2022,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/0301208d-258a-444a-8ef7-66e433d801b1/9e94f337-f70e-4605-b55c-e11373157d9a.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["pt-br","es-la","en","vi","id","ru","pl","fr"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.61,"follows":73704,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:05:15.313Z","chapters":[{"id":"57c60c8c-77aa-4552-a08b-93f87251bb09","number":"49","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":26,"createdAt":"2026-09-20T01:46:46+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"e19c15fe-6ee3-4534-a8e1-682a972571ce","number":"48","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":23,"createdAt":"2026-08-18T01:20:39+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"2c348b53-b249-480c-9519-97c072bb46d6","number":"47","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":34,"createdAt