 his title,  \nthe vile and infamous Duke Thessar Nathan Ardiel?!  \n  \nThe man sobbing his eyes out, telling her that he'd do absolutely anything if she'd wed him- is that very Duke!  \nWhat is Senia supposed to do with him!?  \n  \nWe present Senia's guide to rearing a crybaby villainous Duke: \"The Villain Demands I Love Him\"!  \n  \n[Official Indo](ttps://kakaopage.co.id/content/The-Villain-Demands-I-LoveHim/3393)","year":null,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"70","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Historical","Romance","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/3deba31a-3242-4d07-add5-22de2fa7d089/d0d262ec-92d0-4621-bfcd-a11ba5ffbc6b.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en","fr"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":7.29,"follows":14840,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:05:35.617Z","chapters":[{"id":"c4280467-a071-46bb-a3b2-0c75d883b9a9","number":"14","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":9,"createdAt":"2021-03-18T00:08:36+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"3d79c807-61c9-4515-9895-90389f720337","number":"13","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":10,"createdAt":"2021-03-16T10:45:01+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"5baf3748-79a3-420c-a1e4-4e3c502071e3","number":"12","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":5,"createdAt":"2021-03-16T10:43:02+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"f4e909ce-0683-4ab8-9619-75e440847649","number":"11","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":5,"createdAt":"2021-01-18T16:28:30+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"0ede73b8-822e-4a2a-bae2-572579f85445","number":"10","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":6,"createdAt":"2021-01-17T12:40:24+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"7a973b95-78f1-474b-9c68-fca5941a99d6","number":"9","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":5,"createdAt":"2021-01-15T16:35:47+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"514ec205-e1e5-44d6-95b4-f77d19239d56","number":"8","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":7,"createdAt":"2021-03-16T10:43:06+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"82e10160-7